# ⛔⛔ THE UNIT OF THE BOX IS CONTENTION, NOT THE WORD "SUITE" (2026-09-03, cell asked; boss ruled).
#   A `MIX_ENV=prod` compile loads CPU and disk exactly like a test run, and a door measuring
#   timing-shaped behaviour is contaminated the same way. ⇒ Compiles need a window too.
